('friends', 3, 'What is a fear you have about losing touch with people you love?', '¿Qué miedo tienes de perder contacto con la gente que quieres?'),
('friends', 3, 'When did you last feel truly lonely, even with people around?', '¿Cuándo te sentiste realmente solo por última vez, incluso rodeado de gente?'),
('friends', 3, 'What is the closest you have come to telling someone off, and did not?', '¿Cuál ha sido el momento más cercano en que casi le dices sus verdades a alguien, y no lo hiciste?'),
('friends', 3, 'What is something this group has never seen you struggle with?', '¿Con qué has batallado que este grupo nunca ha visto?'),
('friends', 3, 'What is a friendship you let fade that you still think about?', '¿Qué amistad dejaste apagar que todavía recuerdas?'),
('friends', 3, 'What do you think you owe the people who have stuck around for you?', '¿Qué crees que le debes a la gente que se ha quedado a tu lado?'),
